.Ss Locally integrate 12 open GitHub PRs into main
.Ss Summary
Merged 12 open PRs into local
.Ql "main"
(no push) and validated the result with remote builders disabled
.No \&( Ns Ql "--builders ''"
/
.Ql "NIX_CONFIG=\(dqbuilders =\(dq" ).
Ten were ready Codex-authored security/hardening fixes; two were drafts (#145, #155) that overlapped ready PRs and were integrated on top.
PR #123 was excluded — it targets the
.Ql "next-new"
branch, not
.Ql "main" .
.Ss PRs merged (in order)
